    "text": "By Molly Minnium ,\n21 hours ago Hosted by Snoop Dogg, the MTV Video Music Awards will air live from Los Angeles this Sunday. This year’s most-nominated artist, Madonna, will be opening the show with her first VMA performance in 23 years. Madonna is up for artist of the year, and her work in “Confessions II — The Film” racked up eight nominations alone. Read full article",
